"""IB MYP 3 Individuals and Societies (integrated humanities) – ib-g8-social-science.

Criteria: A knowing and understanding, B investigating, C communicating, D thinking critically (MYP year 3
descriptors). Items use MYP command terms and real places, dated events and attributed (paraphrased) sources;
numerical skills (map scale, grid references, climate graphs, density, natural increase, discharge, opportunity
cost, budgeting) come from parametric generators with computed answers. Mocks follow the MYP 5 eAssessment
shape (3 tasks, 15 items, 80 marks) so students practise the format early.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

