            ('A population with a birth rate of 10 per 1 000 and a death rate of 12 per 1 000 has…', 'a natural decrease of 0.2% per year', ['a natural increase of 2%', 'no change', 'a natural increase of 0.2%'], '(10 − 12) ÷ 10 = −0.2%.'),
