     src=[('Government report (paraphrased)', 'The minister announced a moratorium on the northern cod fishery. Scientists had found that the spawning stock had fallen to the lowest level ever measured. The closure would affect thousands of fishers and plant workers, and the government would provide income support.', 'Paraphrase of the announcement by the Canadian Minister of Fisheries and Oceans, 2 July 1992', 'to announce and justify the closure of the fishery to the public and to fishing communities', 'It is the official announcement and shows the scientific evidence the government relied on.', 'As a government statement it does not discuss why earlier warnings and quotas failed.', 'Cod stocks had collapsed, so the fishery was closed despite the economic cost.')],
